 "remarks": "Discover 102 Valley Road, Unit 20, a picture-perfect, beautifully upgraded two-bedroom, one-and-a-half-bath residence in the sought-after Portal Rock II community in Greenwich, CT. Freshly painted, enhanced with new appliances, and thoughtfully updated throughout, no stone has been left unturned in creating this inviting, move-in-ready home. The expansive private terrace is a rare condominium luxury--perfect for entertaining, or simply enjoying your own peaceful outdoor retreat. The main level offers comfortable, easy living, while the versatile lower level features a home office or den, space for a gym, and abundant storage. Easy access to the Cos Cob train station, local schools, village shops, restaurants, and the Cos Cob Library. Simply unpack and enjoy the best of Cos Cob living!",
